Recount DCGM bindings

The ABI declarations in src/ffi/raw.rs and fixtures/runtime.c are derived from
NVIDIA DCGM v4.7.0 dcgm_structs.h and dcgm_agent.h. Test-only fake/injection
declarations also derive from dcgm_structs_internal.h and dcgm_test_apis.h:
https://github.com/NVIDIA/DCGM/tree/9fae2867e6e5264fa0fca22a07dc898d591baa21/dcgmlib

