The Rust declarations are a reduced, modified binding, not NVIDIA's full headers.

fixtures/nvidia-profiling-example.txt transcribes the published numerical example
from NVIDIA's DCGM profiling guide and identifies its source. Synthetic wrappers
and the native ABI test shim are not recordings of the owner's hardware.

No NVIDIA driver, DCGM runtime, CUDA library or proprietary profiling module is
included. Installed runtime components retain their own distribution terms.
